'' TKO0903 notes for errors Check finds in a re-parsed generic body: MarkInstBody_
'' (instframe.tiko) marks the body's nodes, WalkAll and the inference pre-pass enter the
'' frame, and an unviable call is reported once (overload.tiko).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/module-generic-note.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' Since RFC 0019 R5 the key's hash is 'hashvalue( k )', so the error is TKO1266, not TKO0632.
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO1266: hashvalue( ) cannot hash 'cell'
'' EXPECT-OUT: module-generic-note.bas(11,16): note: in instantiation of 'map( of cell, ustring )'
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 3
